<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 430 MLN NBP-BILL.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 430 MLN NBP-BILL.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish banks bid for 430 million zlotys of 273-day NBP-bills at a 300 million zloty tender, the NBP said.</p>
<p>Full details of the auction should be available at about 1300 local time.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
